cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, optical ray-tracing framework, or reconstructed light-guide geometry in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "LHCb PicoCal Conical Light-Guide Optical Simulation & Inverse Surface Reconstruction Toolkit"
authors:
