    given-names: "Hengne"
    email: "Hengne.Li@cern.ch"
    affiliation: "South China Normal University (SCNU) & LHCb Collaboration, CERN"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - "LHCb"
  - "PicoCal"
  - "Light Guide"
  - "Ray Tracing"
  - "Inverse Problem"
  - "Geant4"
  - "Metal GPU"
abstract: >-
  Cross-platform 3D freeform specular ray-tracing simulation, periodic bicubic
  B-spline nonlinear inverse surface reconstruction, Geant4 optical-photon
  cross-validation, and interactive 3D/SVG/HTML5 visualization suite for
  diagnosing micron-scale inner-wall deformations in LHCb Upgrade II PicoCal
  conical light guides from 2D laser uniformity bench scans.
